## assets/ — the full-size hand-painted originals (~2.6MB each).
## World-card originals are preserved through Git LFS; all other originals
## stay local. What ships is still only the 480px output under
## ChizuHakase/Resources/Assets.xcassets/CardArt/: the app target's sources are
## ChizuHakase/ only, so LFS originals cannot enter the app bundle by accident.
assets/*
!assets/world-cards/
assets/world-cards/*
!assets/world-cards/*.png

## tmp/ — scratch space for generating card art before it is cut down.
## Same rule: originals stay out.
tmp/

## tools/ — large intermediates. PrefectureShapes.json itself IS committed
## (see CLAUDE.md §3: generated but checked in, never rebuilt at build time).
## Same rule for the world atlas: WorldShapes.json is committed, the raw and
## simplified Natural Earth geojson stay out.
tools/japan.geojson
tools/japan_simplified.geojson
tools/ne_50m_countries.geojson
tools/ne_50m_simplified.geojson
tools/ne_10m_countries.geojson
tools/node_modules/
tools/package-lock.json
tools/package.json
tools/__pycache__/
